# The build context is the repository root. Send only what the commerce image needs:
# the workspace files, every workspace manifest (so pnpm sees the same projects as
# the lockfile), the packages commerce builds on, and the data set it seeds from.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/*/package.json
!design/*/package.json
!services/*/package.json
!packages/
!services/commerce/
!data/met/catalog.json
!data/met/images/

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
services/commerce/assets
services/commerce/test
